OL,3,AParis extends curfew as Marseille and
OL,4,ALyon ban protests after riots
OL,5,
OL,6,FParis is extending a partial curfew
OL,7,Frestricting movement in parts of the
OL,8,Fcity until Monday, as Marseille and
OL,9,FLyon impose a total ban on protests
OL,10,Fthis weekend.
OL,12,FThe Louvre, Orsay and Picasso museums
OL,13,Fin the French capital will also be
OL,14,Fclosed on Saturday as more
OL,15,Fdemonstrations are expected.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
