OL,3,AParis extends curfew as Marseille and
OL,4,ALyon ban protests after riots
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrance is still reeling from major
OL,7,Fdisorder at the weekend, when large
OL,8,Fprotests against the high cost of
OL,9,Fliving and school conditions were
OL,10,Fovershadowed by riots and looting that
OL,11,Fsaw business and historic buildings
OL,12,Fdestroyed.
OL,14,FIn other parts of the country where
OL,15,Fprotests have not been banned
OL,16,Fcompletely, only authorised union
OL,17,Fdemonstrations will be allowed on
OL,18,FSaturday, President Emmanuel Macron
OL,19,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
